---
title: "News & Events"
description: "Press releases, legal bulletins, and the ADLG events calendar."
permalink: "/news/index.html"
---
<div class="page-hero"><h1>News &amp; Events</h1><p>Press releases, legal bulletins, and upcoming events.</p></div>
<section class="section">
<div class="news-grid">
{% for post in collections.newsPosts %}
<a href="{{ post.url }}" class="news-card" style="display:block;color:inherit;">
<span class="tag">{{ post.data.tag }}</span>
<h4>{{ post.data.title }}</h4>
<p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
</a>
{% else %}
<p style="color:#888;">No news posts yet — add one via the CMS at /admin, or drop a new .md file into content/news/.</p>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</section>
<section class="section section-alt">
<h2>Events Calendar</h2>
<div class="grid">
{% for e in events.items %}
<div class="card"><h4>{{ e.title }}</h4><p>{{ e.location }}</p></div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</section>
<section class="section">
<h2>Latest Social Updates</h2>
<p style="text-align:center;color:#888;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:-24px;margin-bottom:30px;">Edit these via the CMS at /admin \u2014 paste in real post links once your accounts are ready.</p>
<div class="social-grid">
<div class="social-embed-card">
<h4>X (Twitter) Post</h4>
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">{{ social.twitterText }}</p>&mdash; ADLG (@{{ social.twitterHandle }})</blockquote>
<script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div>
<div class="social-embed-card">
<h4>Facebook Post</h4>
<iframe src="https://www.facebook.com/plugins/post.php?href={{ social.facebookPostUrl }}&width=500" width="100%" height="400" style="border:none;overflow:hidden;" scrolling="no" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="true" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; web-share"></iframe>
</div>
<div class="social-embed-card">
<h4>Instagram Post</h4>
<blockquote class="instagram-media" data-instgrm-permalink="{{ social.instagramPostUrl }}" data-instgrm-version="14" style="width:100%;"></blockquote>
<script async src="//www.instagram.com/embed.js"></script>
</div>
</div>
</section>
